    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CSP202m · Assessment 2/5</span>\n<h2>Group Project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13645 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CSP202m · Đầu điểm 2/5</span>\n<h2>Group Project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13645 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">in class and homework</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1-&gt;CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">In group of 3-5, develop a PR campaign which may include: - SMART Objectives, Campaign Channels, Campaign Mediums, Media List, Content, Pitch, Target audience, stakeholders.Then generate pieces of content for your campaign such as media posts, blog, or press release. Students are allowed to use AI to generate types of content.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Possess the necessary skills and abilities to develop and implement effective public relations plans for a wide range of entertainment activities.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Suggested criteria:<br><br>Campaign (80%)<br><br>SMART Objectives (20%)<br><br>Campaign Channels (10%)<br><br>Campaign Mediums (10%)<br><br>Media List (5%)<br><br>Content Plan (5%)<br><br>Pitch (5%)<br><br>Target audience (5%)<br><br>Content pieces (10%)<br><br>- AI usage (10%)<br><br>Oral presentations (20%)<br><br>- Content (5%)<br><br>- Quality of presentation slides and/or any other multimedia production if it has (5%)<br><br>- Verbal and non-verbal delivery (5%)<br><br>- Critical and logical responses to questions raised by examiners (5%)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">According to the predetermined LOs, lecturers have the flexibility to choose assignment forms.<br><br>Each assignment has a six-day due date, which commences when the lecture provides detailed instructions.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 52 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 53 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 54 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 55 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 56 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Session 57 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 52 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 53 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 54 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 55 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 56 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li><li>Buổi 57 — GROUP PRESENTATION</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=CSP202m\">Exam Room — CSP202m</a> (1 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=CSP202m\">Phòng thi — CSP202m</a> (1 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
